# Eval fixtures (issue #11): .eml Intakes (any case) and expected.json labels are ignored except
# the .eml files (lower case; on case-insensitive file systems any case) and expected.json directly
# in the synthetic folder, so real fixtures are not committed by accident; `git add -f` still can.
# Eval results stay local too.
*.[eE][mM][lL]
expected.json
!/packages/eval-harness/fixtures/synthetic/*.eml
!/packages/eval-harness/fixtures/synthetic/expected.json
**/fixtures/real/
**/fixtures/private/
eval-results/
